{
  "_schema": "评测用例集。每条 case 由 backend/app/eval/runner.py 读取。\n  category: route | guide\n  route 类 context: {route_id, preference} → 调 /routes/adjust（agent 或规则版）\n  guide 类 context: {poi_id} → 调讲解 agent\n  expect 为可规则核对的期望信号（见 harness/rubrics/rule_checks.md）：\n    route → physical/interests 应被加入 preference_after；added_tag 期望节点被插入；\n           removed_tail 期望末端被裁；keywords_any 期望出现在解释里\n    guide  → keywords_any 期望出现在讲解里；max_len/min_len 长度约束\n  source: 灵感出处（小红书真实评论/笔记，仅离线数据集，见 scripts/clean_xhs.py）",
